{"title":"Salamander Crest","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ember Salamander, Cinder Salamander, Magma Salamander, Old Ashbelly</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ember-salamander\" title=\"Ember Salamander - dropped it in 95 of 112 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e1517afefc1890150bb6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Salamander</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"cinder-salamander\" title=\"Cinder Salamander - dropped it in 45 of 56 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9d394f89e1b48a06813e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Cinder Salamander</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"magma-salamander\" title=\"Magma Salamander - dropped it in 8 of 10 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a6d2bc9ea73c375ee9e5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Magma Salamander</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"old-ashbelly\" title=\"Old Ashbelly - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4a9631e981221928a7a2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Ashbelly</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"salamander-crest\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"Salamander Crest\"></div><h3>Salamander Crest</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/7/2026, 9:00:17 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}